# What `make export` publishes to the public repo.
# One fnmatch glob per line against repo paths (* crosses /); `!` excludes; the last
# matching line wins. Anything not matched stays in the private repo.
mods/*
native/Makefile
native/src/*
native/lua/*
native/test/*
rig/*
tests/*
!tests/test_brainstorm.lua
scripts/*
.github/*
docs/bh-core.md
docs/contracts-0.2.md
docs/SPEC.md
docs/media/*
journal/*
!journal/2026-09-23-relayed-messages-derail-subagents.md
!journal/2026-09-23-make-error-line-gate.md
Makefile
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
LICENSE
.gitignore
